%% Type: architecture · Page: /architecture/sandboxing
flowchart LR
  CP["Control plane<br/>frozen execution manifest · Sandbox Profile digest"] -- "allocate under lease" --> ALLOC["Allocation journal<br/>REQUESTED → READY → RUNNING → RESULT_READY → TERMINATED"]
  ALLOC --> SB
  subgraph SB["Sandbox (one Attempt)"]
    direction TB
    SUP["Root-owned supervisor<br/>hash-chained receipt spool"]
