  V --> PUB["Host-side publication broker<br/>repo-scoped token · one branch · one PR (permit-gated)"]
  SB x-. "never publishes directly" .-x PUB
  CP -- "revoke credentials · terminate · prove absence" --> SB
  class CP,ALLOC,BROKER control
  class SUP,AG,NET execution
  class Q,V,PUB trust
